# ID: DSA-126
# Category: misc
# Algorithm: runtime error: (char) cast of a padham whose length is not 1 (P27)
# Exercises: length-1 conversion succeeds, length-2 fails
# Difficulty: easy
# Expected: "z" then runtime error "invalid char conversion", exit 1
padham a
padham b
a lo "z" pettu
b ni chaduvu
(char) a ni chupi
(char) b ni chupi
"done" ni chupi
